[*][b]Blade Ward Focus Conversion:[/b] Converted to indefinite Focus buff ([i]INNATE_BUFF_BLADE_WARD[/i]), granting continuous physical weapon resistance.
[*][b]Tactical Movement & Action Whitelist:[/b] Added comprehensive whitelist for Jump, Crouch/Stealth, Dash, Disengage, Shove, Dip, Throw, and Help.
